      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stratford_Hall_(plantation)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Construction of Stratford Hall’s Georgian Great House began in the late 1730s, creating a two‑story H‑shaped brick mansion.",
